## Conclusion

The Redis application outage was successfully resolved.

The investigation identified an incorrect ConfigMap reference and an invalid Redis image tag. Both issues were corrected without deleting the existing Deployment.

Kubernetes successfully completed the rollout, created a healthy replacement pod, and restored the application to its desired replica count.

